The [[Amulet of Darkness]] is a rare item normally obtained by buying the [[Unidentified Amulet]] from the shop. When {{icon/star}} items activate, there is a chance to deal {{icon/effect}} damage, and once enough is dealt (from any {{icon/effect}}-source), it will also inflict 1 debuff. Primarily this is useful as a bit of extra damage, placed next to a few fast-activating items. The damage can be quite significant for a non-[[weapon]] item.

